{"correlation_id": "d0732926-a03e-4e66-9cf4-182c8500d2f2", "start_time": 1770934780.9318318, "audio_duration_sec": 1.076, "asr_duration": 0.7193610668182373, "asr_confidence": 0.8754155115148434, "asr_text": "Paulus schreibt.", "asr_word_count": 2, "llm_duration": 1.8794541358947754, "llm_text": "Paul writes.", "llm_word_count": 2, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 4.257489919662476, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 416332, "e2e_duration": 14.49178409576416, "rtf": 13.468, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:19:55.423629"}
{"correlation_id": "73cb3f69-8f80-4a95-8f95-8874b4ac1cb4", "start_time": 1770934785.698317, "audio_duration_sec": 3.508, "asr_duration": 0.5767333507537842, "asr_confidence": 0.9370501239723821, "asr_text": "Wisst ihr nicht, dass die, welche in der Rennbahn laufen,", "asr_word_count": 10, "llm_duration": 5.284086465835571, "llm_text": "Do you not know that those who run in the race must run to win?", "llm_word_count": 15, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 2.236452102661133, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 186956, "e2e_duration": 11.97256064414978, "rtf": 3.413, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:19:57.670892"}
{"correlation_id": "04068ff9-bcd3-4aea-bdc1-0bb7e0487e08", "start_time": 1770934787.205332, "audio_duration_sec": 1.492, "asr_duration": 0.6519126892089844, "asr_confidence": 0.8009763679155142, "asr_text": "Zwar alle laufen,", "asr_word_count": 3, "llm_duration": 1.8669183254241943, "llm_text": "Yet all run", "llm_word_count": 3, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.2515623569488525, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 71244, "e2e_duration": 11.72075366973877, "rtf": 7.856, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:19:58.926096"}
{"correlation_id": "7a3e22b9-3213-4637-bc4d-de4209648cea", "start_time": 1770934789.2142856, "audio_duration_sec": 2.1, "asr_duration": 0.8546342849731445, "asr_confidence": 0.8447800534577445, "asr_text": "aber einer den Preis empfängt?", "asr_word_count": 5, "llm_duration": 2.682213306427002, "llm_text": "but who receives the reward?", "llm_word_count": 5, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.245922327041626, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 95820, "e2e_duration": 11.162490606307983, "rtf": 5.315, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:00.376791"}
{"correlation_id": "f60c5532-883f-4a8f-b059-6f99fd975082", "start_time": 1770934792.9862287, "audio_duration_sec": 2.42, "asr_duration": 1.0071535110473633, "asr_confidence": 0.9027317829141455, "asr_text": "Lauft so, dass ihr ihn erlangt.", "asr_word_count": 6, "llm_duration": 2.733107089996338, "llm_text": "Run so that you may obtain it.", "llm_word_count": 7, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.8734493255615234, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 111180, "e2e_duration": 9.751595258712769, "rtf": 4.03, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:02.737846"}
{"correlation_id": "f48ae190-43d4-4f75-98d1-356634cc9c23", "start_time": 1770934796.2474644, "audio_duration_sec": 1.844, "asr_duration": 0.8771867752075195, "asr_confidence": 0.8670428321600439, "asr_text": "Jeder aber, der kämpft,", "asr_word_count": 4, "llm_duration": 2.4085679054260254, "llm_text": "But every one who fights,", "llm_word_count": 5, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.6964142322540283, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 151116, "e2e_duration": 9.722253322601318, "rtf": 5.272, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:05.969733"}
{"correlation_id": "955f392b-3d9c-4fd3-8ae4-34d38b5e5ab4", "start_time": 1770934798.0044792, "audio_duration_sec": 1.812, "asr_duration": 0.8332393169403076, "asr_confidence": 0.8011719438533252, "asr_text": "ist enthaltsam in allem.", "asr_word_count": 4, "llm_duration": 2.6211349964141846, "llm_text": "is含蓄在一切中.", "llm_word_count": 1, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.7295539379119873, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 144460, "e2e_duration": 10.619856357574463, "rtf": 5.861, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:08.624348"}
{"correlation_id": "736973cb-7710-4866-a45a-f3a6c6175b47", "start_time": 1770934799.2569559, "audio_duration_sec": 0.436, "asr_duration": 0.63681960105896, "asr_confidence": 0.5064455104331599, "asr_text": "... Musik ...", "asr_word_count": 3, "llm_duration": 1.8242123126983643, "llm_text": "... Music ...", "llm_word_count": 3, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 4.580022573471069, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 472172, "e2e_duration": 14.042418956756592, "rtf": 32.207, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:13.299389"}
{"correlation_id": "e0abd810-0810-46f2-a735-e1ba96d45fd4", "start_time": 1770934803.2724817, "audio_duration_sec": 4.148, "asr_duration": 0.633326530456543, "asr_confidence": 0.9315485903418363, "asr_text": "Jene freilich, damit sie einen vergänglichen Siegeskranz empfangen.", "asr_word_count": 8, "llm_duration": 4.103159189224243, "llm_text": "That they may receive a perishable crown of victory.", "llm_word_count": 9, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.2507915496826172, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 162380, "e2e_duration": 11.290149211883545, "rtf": 2.722, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:14.562644"}
{"correlation_id": "dd3ec89b-dbf2-480a-8ff7-b23c77373a68", "start_time": 1770934805.2942464, "audio_duration_sec": 1.236, "asr_duration": 0.6239361763000488, "asr_confidence": 0.637918790917907, "asr_text": "Wir aber.", "asr_word_count": 2, "llm_duration": 1.9712369441986084, "llm_text": "We, however.", "llm_word_count": 2, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.550482988357544, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 71244, "e2e_duration": 10.050624370574951, "rtf": 8.132, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:15.344880"}
{"correlation_id": "9d3ebcc2-c355-41a9-aed1-c598b3854de0", "start_time": 1770934807.051758, "audio_duration_sec": 1.684, "asr_duration": 0.8174045085906982, "asr_confidence": 0.8353680966403548, "asr_text": "einen unvergänglichen.", "asr_word_count": 2, "llm_duration": 2.1305298805236816, "llm_text": "an incorruptible.", "llm_word_count": 2, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.6098616123199463, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 77900, "e2e_duration": 10.4833505153656, "rtf": 6.225, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:17.535122"}
{"correlation_id": "6938de39-fe86-41d8-982d-30584f835ae0", "start_time": 1770934811.8167663, "audio_duration_sec": 2.804, "asr_duration": 1.1096463203430176, "asr_confidence": 0.9269963351681921, "asr_text": "Ich laufe nun so nicht wie ins Ungewisse.", "asr_word_count": 8, "llm_duration": 3.2536098957061768, "llm_text": "I no longer run as one who runs uncertainly.", "llm_word_count": 9, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.7888774871826172, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 149068, "e2e_duration": 10.151320457458496, "rtf": 3.62, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:21.968100"}
{"correlation_id": "997f640f-cacb-4bae-a8da-2531d70a8a26", "start_time": 1770934815.8315706, "audio_duration_sec": 3.444, "asr_duration": 0.5887537002563477, "asr_confidence": 0.9792825578525428, "asr_text": "Ich kämpfe so nicht wie einer, der in die Luft schlägt.", "asr_word_count": 11, "llm_duration": 3.674009323120117, "llm_text": "I do not fight as one who beateth the air.", "llm_word_count": 10, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 2.004549503326416, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 137804, "e2e_duration": 10.02654242515564, "rtf": 2.911, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:25.858127"}
{"correlation_id": "cd14e645-3407-4af0-9f1f-ef496ff882dc", "start_time": 1770934819.0953667, "audio_duration_sec": 2.74, "asr_duration": 0.5026857852935791, "asr_confidence": 0.9061434115242846, "asr_text": "sondern ich zerschlage meinen Leib.", "asr_word_count": 5, "llm_duration": 2.7591702938079834, "llm_text": "but I will break my body.", "llm_word_count": 6, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.8780980110168457, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 84556, "e2e_duration": 8.395891427993774, "rtf": 3.064, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:27.491270"}
{"correlation_id": "5826b3a5-beef-4a15-b56d-04781cfbbeec", "start_time": 1770934820.599096, "audio_duration_sec": 1.332, "asr_duration": 0.8133940696716309, "asr_confidence": 0.9038169100598277, "asr_text": "Und knechte ihn.", "asr_word_count": 3, "llm_duration": 1.8358683586120605, "llm_text": "And serve him.", "llm_word_count": 3, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.5252499580383301, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 64588, "e2e_duration": 8.375540018081665, "rtf": 6.288, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:28.974649"}
{"correlation_id": "74ba5f8a-d4f7-4ffa-a627-ccb6d177f39a", "start_time": 1770934824.3607726, "audio_duration_sec": 3.284, "asr_duration": 1.0184104442596436, "asr_confidence": 0.9375800609876456, "asr_text": "damit ich nicht, nachdem ich anderen gepredigt habe,", "asr_word_count": 8, "llm_duration": 2.5531532764434814, "llm_text": "lest I should after having preached to others", "llm_word_count": 8, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 1.366532325744629, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 164428, "e2e_duration": 8.008660316467285, "rtf": 2.439, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:32.369448"}
{"correlation_id": "78f55564-cb95-42cc-ac8e-0364a5d955a9", "start_time": 1770934826.3707073, "audio_duration_sec": 2.004, "asr_duration": 0.701164722442627, "asr_confidence": 0.9366649050910983, "asr_text": "selbst verwerflich werde.", "asr_word_count": 3, "llm_duration": 2.598093032836914, "llm_text": "myself even I abhor.", "llm_word_count": 4, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.6838123798370361, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 91212, "e2e_duration": 7.9144463539123535, "rtf": 3.949, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:34.285168"}
{"correlation_id": "760d25f4-31c5-4f84-9630-ff824586eb42", "start_time": 1770934832.6568997, "audio_duration_sec": 1.524, "asr_duration": 0.4719080924987793, "asr_confidence": 0.8520862931001401, "asr_text": "Lassen wir erst mal sacken.", "asr_word_count": 5, "llm_duration": 1.9785993099212646, "llm_text": "Let us first sink.", "llm_word_count": 4, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 0.6650047302246094, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 88652, "e2e_duration": 3.588409423828125, "rtf": 2.355, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:36.245318"}
{"correlation_id": "851d6e0b-d011-4574-9c21-ec928a429d7d", "start_time": 1770934840.9324007, "audio_duration_sec": 5.876, "asr_duration": 1.002549171447754, "asr_confidence": 0.9075860346645768, "asr_text": "Der Josef hat uns vorhin schon ein bisschen in den Hintergrund mit reingenommen.  Ich möchte es mal zeitlich einordnen.", "asr_word_count": 19, "llm_duration": 5.119702577590942, "llm_text": "Joseph has already taken us a little behind the scenes earlier. I would like to place it in time now.", "llm_word_count": 20, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 4.217526435852051, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 342636, "e2e_duration": 10.340726613998413, "rtf": 1.76, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:51.273145"}
{"correlation_id": "e48df69f-ac8e-4396-80e7-2a8e06e3f357", "start_time": 1770934847.9578633, "audio_duration_sec": 6.452, "asr_duration": 1.874910593032837, "asr_confidence": 0.9518309780847392, "asr_text": "Die frühe Gemeinde in Korinth, die konnte mit diesem Bild, was Paulus ihnen hier schreibt, wahrscheinlich auf Anhieb sehr viel anfangen.", "asr_word_count": 21, "llm_duration": 5.366735458374023, "llm_text": "The early church in Corinth, no doubt, could grasp this image that Paul writes to them very readily.", "llm_word_count": 18, "src_lang": "de", "tgt_lang": "en", "tts_duration": 3.380821466445923, "tts_audio_size_bytes": 273996, "e2e_duration": 10.623287677764893, "rtf": 1.647, "timestamp": "2026-02-12T22:20:58.581169"}
